// Little Linda (Spyro Gyra, 1979)

Tempo 190
KeySig C

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove SambaIntro8

Begin Solo
    Voice Strings
    Cresc mp mf 8
    Octave 5
    Harmony OpenBelow
End
Cresc pp mf 8
Repeat
1         Dm / Em  {2d; 4.c+; 8+1b ~;}
2         Em7
RepeatEnd 4

Label Sign
Repeat
Groove Samba
Volume m

3       GM7
4       CM7
5       Bm7
6        E7

Cresc mf 3

RepeatEnding

Groove SambaPlus
7       Am7
8        D7
9       Bm7      /     E7
Groove SambaFill
10      Am7      /     D7

RepeatEnd
Groove SambaPlus

11      Am7
12       D7
13      GM7
14        /

Groove Samba
Volume m

15      Dm7
16       G7
17      Dm7
18       G7

Groove SambaPlus
Volume f

19      Dm7
20       G7
Decresc mf 2
21      Dm7
22       G7

Groove Samba
Volume m

23      Cm7
24       F7
25      Cm7
26       F7

Groove SambaSus
Volume mf

27     Bbm7
28      Eb7
29      Am7
30       D7

Groove SambaSusPlus
Volume m

31      GM7
32      CM7
33      Bm7
34       E7

Groove SambaSus
Volume mf

35      Am7
36       D7
37       F9
38       E7

Groove SambaPlus
Volume m

39      Am7
40      CM7
41      Bm7
42       E7

Groove Samba
43      Am7
44       D7

If Def ToCoda
  Goto Coda
EndIf

Cresc mf 4

45        Em7
46        Dm7

47        Em7
48        Dm7
49        G7 
50        Dm 

51        G 

Groove SambaFill
Volume m

52        G7

Set ToCoda
Goto Sign

Label Coda

Groove SambaEnd   // This is a 4 bar seq, perfect for us

Decresc pp 4
Solo Decresc ppp 4
Repeat
53        Dm  / Em   {2d;4.c++;1+8b+~;}
54        Em7
RepeatEnd

Seq 4
Volume ff
Solo Volume ffff
55        G  z! {4g+;}

